  "constitutionalAuthorityStatementText": "<pre>[Congressional Record Volume 161, Number 25 (Friday, February 13, 2015)]\nFrom the Congressional Record Online through the Government Publishing Office [<a href='http://www.gpo.gov'>www.gpo.gov</a>]\nBy Mr. KING of Iowa:\nH.R. 987.\nCongress has the power to enact this legislation pursuant\nto the following:\nThis legislation adjusts the formula the federal government\nuses to spend money on federal contracts, therefore, it is\nauthorized by the Constitution under Article 1, Section 8,\nClause 1, which grants Congress its spending power.\n[Page H1070]\n</pre>",
